@startuml AD-04-create-user-account
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor white
 BorderColor black
 DiamondBackgroundColor white
 DiamondBorderColor black
 StartColor black
 EndColor black
}
skinparam swimlaneBorderColor black
skinparam swimlaneTitleFontStyle bold
skinparam conditionStyle InsideDiamond
skinparam wrapWidth 260
skinparam dpi 180
title AD-04: Staff / Manager Account Creation
' Traces: UC-03; FR-02/10/66; NFR-09/11/12.
' Sources: Brief R11; DEC-17, DEC-18, DEC-35, DEC-45; INT-ITA [Q: Account info], [Q: Audit], [Q: Safeguards].
' User decision 2026-10-03: deliver initial password by email; password change remains optional.
|IT Administrator|
start
:Open Create User Account\n(UC-03);
repeat
:Enter details and role;
if (Technician?) then (yes)
  :Enter Certifications;
else (no)
endif
|System|
:Validate fields, email and role;
if (Details valid?) then (yes)
  :Prepare account / Certifications;\nhash initial password;
  :Save; retry failures up to 3 times;
  if (Save successful?) then (yes)
    :Audit creation;\nemail initial login details;
    |IT Administrator|
    :Review creation confirmation;
    stop
  else (no)
    |System|
    :Show not saved;\nretry or contact IT Administrator;
    stop
  endif
else (no)
  |System|
  :Show errors; create no account;
endif
|IT Administrator|
repeat while (Correct and resubmit?) is (yes) not (cancel)
stop
legend bottom
Authenticated IT Administrator. Roles: Driver, Technician or Manager; email is unique.
Certification: Brand, number, expiry. Initial password is emailed; change is optional.
endlegend

@enduml
